      --envs K=V    override file values (repeatable; value taken literally)
  -h, --help        show this help

The file is read only at registration; later calls use the stored environment.
Missing hub variables declared by the tool produce a warning, without failing add.

exit codes: 0 added; 1 error (ArgumentsBad, DotenvBad, PathMissing, ToolDefBad, ToolExists...).
""",
    "rm": """aos-tools rm - remove tool registrations by name or path

